CDLM corrective-training framework (training/)

This directory is a snapshot of the training framework used to train the
Open-dCoder-0.5B CDLM (corrective) and MDLM (baseline) checkpoints reported in
the paper. The repository root is MIT-licensed (../LICENSE). The following
parts of training/ are derived from Apache-2.0 projects and remain under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (full text in training/LICENSE):

  training/veomni/
  training/tasks/
  training/configs/
  training/tools/convert_dcp_to_hf.py

